{"id":"word:hebrew:H2389","type":"word","title":"חָזָק","subtitle":"H2389 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"strong (usu. in a bad sense, hard , bold , violent )","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חָזָק (H2389) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: a.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 56 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חָזָק (châzâq) means strong (usu. in a bad sense, hard , bold , violent ) First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 8 42."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חָזָק","transliteration":"châzâq","pronunciation":"khaw-zawk'","strong":"H2389","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2389","partOfSpeech":"a","forms":["חֲזָקָה֙","חֲזָקָֽה","חָזָ֣ק","חָזָ֥ק","הַ/חֲזָקָ֔ה"],"morphs":[["HAafsa",21],["HAamsa",14],["HTd/Aafsa",10],["HAampa",3],["HC/Aamsa",2],["HR/Aamsa",2],["HC/Aampc",1],["HAampc",1],["HC/Td/Aafsa",1],["HTi/Aamsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"strong (usu. in a bad sense, hard , bold , violent )","usage":"harder, hottest, impudent, loud, mighty, sore, stiff(-hearted), strong(-er).","full":"H2389. chazaq חָזָק adjective strong, stout, mighty ; — ׳ח Exod 10:19 18 t.; feminine חֲזָקָה 3:19 31t. + Ezek 3:14 (Co for ᵑ0 verb 3feminine singular); plural חֲזָקִים Judg 18:25 2 t.; construct חִזְקֵי Ezek 2:4 (strike out Co. see below) 3:7 ; &#8212; 1 strong: a. of men , rarely predicate Num 13:18 (opposed to רָפֶה ), 13:31 (comparative with מִן ), Josh 14:11 ; 17:18 (all J E), Judg 18:26 (comparative with מִן ); also of גֹּאֲלָם Jer 50:34 ; Prov 23:11 ; of hand of ׳י Josh 4:24 (D), so Ezek 3:14 ᵐ5 Co (see above and חָזַק Qal 3 ); compare of Tyre בַּיָּם חֲזָקָה הָֽיְתָה 26:17 (strike out B Co). b. usually attributive; of ram of Pharaoh Ezek 30:22 (opposed to נִשְׁבָּ֑רֶת ); especially of hand of ׳י in delivering Israel from Egypt, Exod 3:19 (gloss ? see Di), 6:1 (twice in verse); 13:9 (all J), Deut 6:21 ; 7:8 ; 9:26 ; Dan 9:15 ; in wonders done by agency of Moses Deut 34:12 ; also חֲזָקָה וּבְיָד גָּדוֺל בְּכֹחַ Exod 31:11 (JE), compare Neh 1:10 , but oftener נְטוּיָה וּבִזְרוֺעַ חזקה ביד Deut 4:34 ; 5:15 ; 7:19 ; 11:2 ; 26:6 ; Jer 32:21 ; Psa 136:12 ; of control of enemies and deliverance from exile Ezek 20:33-34 , more Generally Deut 3:24 (|| גָּדְלְךָ ), 1Kin 8:42 2Chr 6:32 ; of ׳י s opposition to Zedekiah Jer 21:5 ; once of Edom, opposed to Israel חזקה וביד כבד בעם Num 20:20 (JE). c. of sword of ׳י Isa 27:1 (|| וְהַגְּדוֺלָה הַקָּשָׁה ), of wind Exod 10:19 (J), 1Kin 19:11 ; sound of trumpet (= loud ) Exod 19:16 (E). d severe, sharp, hot , of war 1Sam 14:52 (predicate), battle 2Sam 11:15 , sickness 1Kin 17:17 (predicate), famine 18:2 . e. firm, hard , of face, פנים Ezek 3:8 , forehead, מֵצַח 3:8 ; adamant, simile of forehead 3:9 (comparative, with מִן ); of sky Job 37:18 (predicate) in plural construct ׳ח לֵב Ezek 2:4 hard of heart (|| פָנִים קְשֵׁי ) but omitted by B Co, מֵֿצַח׳ח 3:7 hard (= impudent) of forehead (|| קְשֵׁילֵֿב ). 2 as substantive, a strong one , of ׳י ( בְּחָזָק , as, in the character of, a strong one ) Isa 40:10 ; of ׳י s agent 28:2 (|| אַמִּץ ); see also כֹחוֺ יְאַמֵּץ לאֹ וְחָזָק Amos 2:14 ; with מִן compare= one too strong for Jer 31:11 ; Psa 35:10 . In Ezek 34:16 ᵑ0 uses ׳הח in bad sense (|| הִשְּׁמֵנָה ), ᵐ5 Co, with different text, in good sense (see VB).","rootNote":"from 2388 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 8 42","keyReferences":["1Kgs 8 42","1Kgs 17 17","1Kgs 18 2","1Kgs 19 11","1Sam 14 52","2Chr 6 32","2Sam 11 15","Amos 2 14"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":56,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 8 42","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":42,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַֽ/חֲזָקָ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aafsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 17 17","book":"1Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָזָ֣ק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 18 2","boo